Now we need to assemble transport leg. The assemble_transport_leg action requires origin_availability_locked, destination_availability_locked, origin_node_ready, destination_node_ready, origin_availability_confirmed, destination_availability_confirmed, transport_leg_available. So after locking and confirming both availabilities, and activating nodes, we can assemble leg.

We need to have transport_leg_available initially (true). After assembling, it becomes not available.

