Now we need to ensure we have enough dispatch_slot availability: we have one dispatch_slot_alpha. We'll allocate and dispatch sequentially.

Now we need to prepare shift_candidate_beta for staging, which requires origin_availability_locked and destination_availability_locked, transport leg assembled, loading authorized, container loaded, etc. We'll need to lock origin and destination availabilities (which we will do as part of preparing them for dispatch). So we can lock them early, then later use them for dispatch.

